; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - ARCHIVED (stopped 2026-11-18 by the user: no rules based on specific days such as gotobi or month-end). Kept for reference only; do not use.
; Ten time-of-day rules from different flows (Tokyo fix, month start/end, London midday); A1 at 1.25x (up to the margin cap), all others at normal risk (2026-11-18: best over all periods, chapters 62, 67 and 68):
;  G3F USDJPY sell 9:55 on gotobi days unless USDJPY fell 9:25-9:55; at 10:15 hold to 12:00 only if >= 3 pips ahead, else close
;  P2 EURJPY buy 9:25-9:55 on gotobi days
;  P4 EURJPY buy 9:25-9:55 on Fridays   Q2 EURJPY sell 9:55-12:00 on gotobi days only after a strong 9:25-9:55 rise
;  C3 EURJPY sell 10:00-11:00 on month-end       C4 GBPJPY sell 22:00-24:00 (Tokyo) on the first 2 weekdays
;  A1 EURUSD sell 11:00-12:59 London time, every weekday   C7 USDJPY buy 17:00-19:00 (Tokyo) on the last weekday of the month
;  C6 GBPJPY sell 17:00-18:00 (Tokyo) on the first 2 weekdays   P8 USDJPY buy 8:00-9:55 (Tokyo) on gotobi days
;  C4 and C6 (GBPJPY) accept spreads up to 3 pips (others 1.5), chapter 76
;  P8 stop loss 15 pips (exit early on gotobi mornings without pre-fix dollar buying), chapter 78
;  When G3F or P8 hits the 30-lot cap (balance above about 20 million yen), the part cut off is traded in EURJPY (G3E, P8E), chapter 78
; Rules whose last 100 virtual trades have PF < 0.9 are paused automatically (after 60 trades)
; Full compounding (no monthly lock); positions sized so the margin level stays >= 110% even if every stop is hit (chapter 75); risk is halved while equity is >25% below its peak (chapter 77); large lots are split into several orders, capped at 30 lots per trade
